# Store apps (apps/mobile-*): what sync or CI writes, and what must never be
# committed — the signing keys, and the Firebase files that name the project.
apps/mobile-*/www/config.js
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
apps/mobile-*/android/app/release/
apps/mobile-*/ios/App/*.ipa
apps/mobile-*/fastlane/report.xml
apps/mobile-*/fastlane/README.md
# Swift Package Manager symlinks that `cap sync ios` makes on this machine (absolute paths); CI makes its own.
apps/mobile-*/ios/App/CapApp-SPM/symlinks/

